# Lifelink from Basilisk Collar works on damage to a player: the equipped, unblocked Llanowar Elves hits Bot2 for 1 and Bot1 gains 1.
# On Bot1's next turn the Collar is equipped to Ornithopter instead (equip {2}, sorcery speed): the Elves lose deathtouch and
# lifelink (they keep nothing, so no keywords at all) and the Ornithopter has flying, deathtouch and lifelink.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Llanowar Elves
Basilisk Collar
Ornithopter
Forest
Forest
Forest x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Basilisk Collar.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Basilisk Collar.Activate(Ability: Equip; Llanowar Elves)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Llanowar Elves > Bot2)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot2.Life = 19
? Bot1.Life = 21
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Basilisk Collar.Activate(Ability: Equip; Ornithopter)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Pass
[T5 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Keywords = (absent)
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Keywords = Deathtouch; Flying; Lifelink

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Basilisk Collar.AttachedTo = Ornithopter
